OL,3,GNEWSANew SEND school to open in
OL,4,Auniversity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new school for children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) will open on a university site.
OL,10,FThe school, set to be based in a
OL,11,FPlymouth Marjon University building,
OL,12,Fwould serve as a dedicated space for
OL,13,Finnovative programs, project leaders
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe university confirmed a five-year
OL,17,Flease of the Studio School building to
OL,18,FElementa Education Group Ltd, with
OL,19,Fprograms delivered through Elmtree
OL,20,FLearning Partnership alternative
OL,21,Fprovision and Elmtree Sands SEND School
OL,22,Ffor Year 6 to Year 11.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
